---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Amro Studio" description="Learn about Amro Studio and our approach." path="/about">
  <section class="page-shell py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="glass-card fade-up p-7 sm:p-10">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--brand)]">About Us</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">A small team focused on practical, high-value websites.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">
        We help businesses launch modern web presence quickly using static-first technology. Our process prioritizes
        clear messaging, visual quality, and long-term affordability.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface-soft)] p-5">
          <h2 class="text-lg">Strategy</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--muted)]">Content and page structure built around real customer journeys.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface-soft)] p-5">
          <h2 class="text-lg">Design</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--muted)]">Clean, modern interfaces that feel premium and mobile-ready.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface-soft)] p-5">
          <h2 class="text-lg">Delivery</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--muted)]">Fast builds, low maintenance, and simple deployment workflows.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
